    <Annotation>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Version history:

2025-07-04 :

- Restructuring of the Data Definition Components
    - Renaming of DataObjectDefinition to DataElementDefinition- 
    - Restructuring the SubjectDataDefinition to be a direct subclass of  DataDescribingComponent to be on the same level as PayloadDescription (could possibly also have a matching substructure that differs between physical and data content
2021-05-19 Version 1.1.0: I2PM Standardization Meeting Spring 2021

Participants:
Matthes Elstermann – Karlsruhe Institute of Technology (KIT) matthes.elstermann@kit.edu
Herbert Kindermann – Kindermann Consulting
Robert Singer – FH Joanneum Graz
Florian Krenn – Compunity, Linz, Austria
Werner Schmidt – TH Ingolstadt
Matthias Lederer – OTH Weiden
Christian Stary – Universität Linz
André Wolski – TU Darmstadt
Albert Fleischmann – Interaktiv Unternehmensberatung

Agreed on changes:
- new Class SubjectExecutionMapping
- performance improvements
- clarification regarding EndState usage in SubjectBehavior


2018-11-22 Version 1.0.0: Standardization Meeting Ingolstadt

Agreed on Version 1.0.0 from meeting:

Participants
- Werner Schmidt
- Herbert Kindermann
- Bernhard Foltin
- André Wolski
- Florian Krenn
- Albert Fleischmann
- Matthes Elstermann

2018-11-09: Elstermann (Proposal)

clarifications for Send and Receive Transition Conditions and Sending and Receiving in regards to subjects with multiple instances (Multi-Subjects)

Transition--&gt; hasTransitionCondition--&gt; information about sending and receiving

ReceiveTransitionCondition
   hasReceiveType
    - ReceiveTypeMultiReceiveFromAllKnown
    - ReceiveTypeMultiReceiveFromKnwon
    - ReceiveTypeStandard
	
    hasMultiReceiveLowerBound
    hasMultiReceiveUpperBound

    requiresReceptionOfMessage
    requiresMessageSentFrom

SendTransitionCondition

  hasSendType
   - SendingTypeMultiSendToAll
   - SendingTypeMultiSendToKnown
   - SendingTypeMultiSendToNew
   - SendingTypeStandard

  hasMultiSendLowerBound
  hasMultiSendUpperBound

  requiresSendingOfMessage  (SendTransition)
  requiresMessageSentTo (SendTransition)


2018-07-05: Ingolstadt Review.

- current Status after
- Participants:
 - Herbert Kindermann
 - Albert Fleischmann
 - Werner Schmidt
 - Florian Krenn
 - Florian J. Strecker
 - Matthes Elstermann</Literal>
    </Annotation>
